# Relay builds need only package sources and package metadata.
# Keep vaults, deployment settings, worktrees, tests and tooling caches outside
# the build context, including files not covered by the repository's .gitignore.
**
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
!docs/
!docs/syncd/
!docs/syncd/Dockerfile
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
